        },
        {
          "text": "Uku ni k’Uhoraho agize, ati Ni muce imanza ziroranye n’izigororotse, mukize ūnyazwe, mumukūre mu kuboko kw’ ūmuhahaza; ntimugirire nabi canke ngo muhahaze ingenzi n’ impfuvyi n’umupfakazi, canke ngo muvishirize aha hantu amaraso y’ abatācumuye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.17.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 17:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko ni mwagenza murtyo koko, ni ho mu birimba vy’iki gisagara hazoca abami uko bakūranwa ku ngoma ya Dawidi, bagendera mu mikogote no ku mafarasi, umwami wese n’ abasavyi biwe n’abantu biwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
