            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ntimukaririre uwamaze gupfa, canke ngo mumuborogere: ariko muririre uwagiye mazimayongo, kukw atazoba akigaruka ukundi, canke ngw asubire kubona igihugu yavukiyemwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.10",
