        },
        {
          "text": "Azobona ibara uwubakisha inzu yiwe mu biva mu kugabitanya, akayitegurisha ibigungano; agakoresha mugenzi we ku kagōbēro, ntamuhe ingero yiwe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
